---
title: Visual Artifact Subsystem
---
flowchart TB
    User([User or confirmed MCP call]) --> Guard[Owned visual boundary<br/>limits, integrity and user scope]
    Forget([Delete all personal memory]) --> Repository
    Guard --> Route{Capability}

    Route -->|diagram| Diagram[DeepSeek V4 Flash<br/>validated Mermaid]
    Route -->|new or edit| Image[FLUX.2 Klein<br/>generation or source edit]
    Route -->|analyze| Vision[Qwen3-VL-8B inspection<br/>plus optional specialist retry]
    Route -->|recall| Recall[One Qwen modality gate<br/>then ranked owned retrieval]

    Vision --> Confidence[Evidence-aware answer<br/>only high-confidence identity is indexed]
    Diagram --> Repository[Owned artifact repository]
    Image --> Repository
    Confidence --> Repository
    Repository --> Store[(PostgreSQL metadata, lineage and vectors<br/>opaque private files)]
    Store --> Recall
    Recall --> Context[Owner-validated<br/>bounded visual context]
    Context --> UI[Chat and artifact UI]
    Repository --> UI

    classDef interface fill:#f5f5f7,stroke:#86868b,color:#1d1d1f;
    classDef application fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#5e8fc4,color:#102a43;
    classDef data fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#5f9562,color:#183b1b;
    classDef external fill:#f1edff,stroke:#8872c6,color:#2e2450;
    class User,UI,Forget interface;
    class Guard,Route,Repository,Context,Confidence application;
    class Store data;
    class Diagram,Image,Vision,Recall external;
